venv
output
kalshi_data*
dk_data*
captures
participants*.json
__pycache__
.pytest_cache
20*

# A competition build belongs to the run that made it, not to the source tree.
# build/ holds the result JSON, dist/ holds the page and zip handed to the user.
build/
dist/

# Leagues are the user's own rosters. The worked example is checked in; anything
# else they drop in here stays theirs.
leagues/*.json
!leagues/example-league.json

# Test fixtures are checked in on purpose; the patterns above would swallow them.
!tests/fixtures/dk_data.json
!tests/fixtures/participants.json
